// Build-time secrets for the iOS app. Copy this file to mobile/.env (same directory, gitignored)
// and fill in the real value. The four mobile/iosApp/Config/*.xcconfig files include it with an
// optional `#include? "../../.env"`, so this template stays a valid xcconfig fragment: one
// KEY=VALUE per line, `//` comments only (a `#` line other than an include is a parse error).
//
// REVENUECAT_PUBLIC_SDK_KEY is the RevenueCat App Store public SDK key (appl_…). It is a public,
// shippable key — it ends up in the app bundle — not a secret credential. Release-Prod refuses to
// build while this is still the placeholder below.
REVENUECAT_PUBLIC_SDK_KEY=REPLACE_WITH_PROD_PUBLIC_SDK_KEY
